{"00_00-open.mp3":{"dur":16.894,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Our topic today is sharps.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":1.956},{"w":"DANA","t":"The hazards that are easy to miss, why a container beats gloves, and what people on the floor really do.","em":[],"s":1.956,"e":9.52},{"w":"DANA","t":"I'm Dana.","em":[],"s":9.52,"e":10.64},{"w":"RAY","t":"And I'm Ray.","em":[],"s":10.64,"e":11.52},{"w":"DANA","t":"Here we go!","em":[],"s":11.52,"e":12.56}]},"01_01-k1-normal.mp3":{"dur":94.0,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Ray, when we were setting up, you brought up used blades left sitting out.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":4.695},{"w":"DANA","t":"Why do those stick with you?","em":[],"s":4.695,"e":6.48},{"w":"RAY","t":"Honestly, because a used blade is a sharp, just like a needle.","em":[],"s":6.48,"e":10.834},{"w":"RAY","t":"It just doesn't look like one.","em":[],"s":10.834,"e":12.64},{"w":"DANA","t":"I always picture needles.","em":[],"s":12.64,"e":14.838},{"w":"DANA","t":"So what counts as a sharp?","em":[],"s":14.838,"e":17.12},{"w":"RAY","t":"A sharp is anything that can puncture or cut the skin, so a used blade counts.","em":[3],"s":17.04,"e":21.983},{"w":"RAY","t":"Needles still show up too, because some people manage diabetes or allergies with injections.","em":[],"s":21.983,"e":27.76},{"w":"DANA","t":"Right.","em":[],"s":27.68,"e":28.276},{"w":"DANA","t":"So how does a blade end up sitting out?","em":[],"s":28.276,"e":31.68},{"w":"RAY","t":"Say you've just changed a blade, but the sharps container is over by the other station.","em":[],"s":31.6,"e":36.308},{"w":"RAY","t":"So you set the old one on top of your toolbox and think, \"I'll come right back for it.\".","em":[],"s":36.308,"e":41.04},{"w":"DANA","t":"That sounds kind of like something I'd do.","em":[],"s":41.04,"e":43.569},{"w":"DANA","t":"What's the harm if you come right back?","em":[],"s":43.569,"e":45.76},{"w":"RAY","t":"Somebody else might reach for that spot.","em":[],"s":45.76,"e":48.39},{"w":"RAY","t":"A used blade is a hazard whether or not you can see anything on it.","em":[],"s":48.39,"e":52.0},{"w":"DANA","t":"Okay, back up.","em":[],"s":51.92,"e":53.02},{"w":"DANA","t":"Say it's still in your hand.","em":[],"s":53.02,"e":55.147},{"w":"DANA","t":"What do you do?","em":[],"s":55.147,"e":56.32},{"w":"RAY","t":"You take it to the container.","em":[],"s":56.32,"e":58.051},{"w":"RAY","t":"And actually, you plan for this before you pick up the blade.","em":[],"s":58.051,"e":61.6},{"w":"DANA","t":"How so?","em":[],"s":61.52,"e":62.64},{"w":"RAY","t":"There are four steps.","em":[],"s":62.64,"e":64.193},{"w":"RAY","t":"One, know your route to the container before you begin.","em":[],"s":64.193,"e":68.146},{"w":"RAY","t":"Two, use a safer tool if one will do the job.","em":[],"s":68.146,"e":71.398},{"w":"RAY","t":"Three, turn on the safety feature if there is one.","em":[],"s":71.398,"e":74.999},{"w":"RAY","t":"Four, put the blade directly into a designated sharps container.","em":[],"s":74.999,"e":79.52},{"w":"DANA","t":"It doesn't go on the toolbox.","em":[],"s":79.44,"e":81.56},{"w":"DANA","t":"What about the regular trash?","em":[],"s":81.56,"e":83.68},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's out too.","em":[],"s":83.68,"e":85.04},{"w":"RAY","t":"A used blade goes straight into the container, every time.","em":[4],"s":85.04,"e":88.8},{"w":"DANA","t":"Got it.","em":[],"s":88.8,"e":89.76},{"w":"RAY","t":"What I tell crews: don't turn that blade into somebody else's problem.","em":[],"s":89.76,"e":94.0}]},"03_02-k2-normal.mp3":{"dur":84.32,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Let's talk about full sharps containers.","em":[],"s":0.1,"e":2.938},{"w":"DANA","t":"I'll admit, I've crammed one more thing into a kitchen trash can that was already full.","em":[],"s":2.938,"e":8.519},{"w":"DANA","t":"I even pushed it down with my hand.","em":[],"s":8.519,"e":10.66},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, a kitchen trash can is one thing.","em":[],"s":10.66,"e":13.46},{"w":"DANA","t":"So is a full sharps container any different?","em":[],"s":13.46,"e":16.42},{"w":"RAY","t":"It is, because a sharps container has a fill line.","em":[],"s":16.42,"e":19.592},{"w":"RAY","t":"Once the sharps reach that line, the container is full.","em":[9],"s":19.592,"e":23.06},{"w":"DANA","t":"So say it's right at the fill line, but there's still a little gap at the top.","em":[],"s":22.98,"e":28.348},{"w":"DANA","t":"Can you use it?","em":[],"s":28.348,"e":29.3},{"w":"RAY","t":"No, you treat it as full and find another designated container.","em":[],"s":29.3,"e":33.394},{"w":"RAY","t":"If you push one more in, your hand ends up close to the sharps already inside.","em":[],"s":33.394,"e":38.42},{"w":"DANA","t":"Okay, that makes sense.","em":[],"s":38.34,"e":40.05},{"w":"DANA","t":"Is a full container the only thing to watch for?","em":[],"s":40.05,"e":43.54},{"w":"RAY","t":"Actually, there's a second one, and it looks nothing like the first.","em":[8],"s":43.46,"e":47.715},{"w":"RAY","t":"It's a sharp that ends up somewhere it doesn't belong.","em":[],"s":47.715,"e":51.06},{"w":"DANA","t":"Where would that be, usually?","em":[],"s":51.06,"e":53.3},{"w":"RAY","t":"It could be on a work surface, hidden in other material, or in the regular trash.","em":[],"s":53.3,"e":58.399},{"w":"RAY","t":"Imagine someone tosses a used blade into a regular trash bin, so the next person to reach in is at risk.","em":[],"s":58.399,"e":64.9},{"w":"DANA","t":"So one hazard is a container that still looks roomy, and the other is a sharp in the wrong place.","em":[],"s":64.9,"e":71.78},{"w":"RAY","t":"Yes, and spotting either one early is how you stop an injury before it happens.","em":[],"s":71.7,"e":77.14},{"w":"RAY","t":"So the rule is this: at the fill line, it's full.","em":[],"s":77.14,"e":80.98},{"w":"DANA","t":"My kitchen trash can could have used a fill line.","em":[],"s":80.98,"e":84.32}]},"02_02-k2-harder.mp3":{"dur":80.64,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Let's talk about sharps containers that are almost full.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":3.579},{"w":"DANA","t":"I'll be honest, if a bin looks like it has room, I just use it without checking the top.","em":[],"s":3.579,"e":9.138},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, that's the tricky thing.","em":[],"s":9.138,"e":11.172},{"w":"RAY","t":"A container can be at its fill line and still have a gap at the top.","em":[],"s":11.172,"e":15.27},{"w":"RAY","t":"From where you're standing, it looks like there's room.","em":[],"s":15.27,"e":18.276},{"w":"DANA","t":"So how would I know it's full?","em":[],"s":18.276,"e":20.441},{"w":"RAY","t":"Look for the fill line, not the gap.","em":[7],"s":20.441,"e":22.762},{"w":"RAY","t":"Once the sharps reach that line, it's full.","em":[],"s":22.762,"e":25.524},{"w":"RAY","t":"Pushing another one in puts your hand close to what's already inside.","em":[],"s":25.524,"e":29.9},{"w":"DANA","t":"So the container can fool you.","em":[],"s":29.9,"e":32.03},{"w":"DANA","t":"Does that happen anywhere else?","em":[],"s":32.03,"e":34.228},{"w":"RAY","t":"Actually, it can happen with a regular trash bin too.","em":[],"s":34.228,"e":37.476},{"w":"RAY","t":"Imagine you walk past one, and something's half-hidden under paper towels, and you can't tell what it is.","em":[],"s":37.476,"e":43.848},{"w":"DANA","t":"So you've got a container with a gap at the top and something in a bin you can't identify.","em":[],"s":43.767,"e":49.672},{"w":"DANA","t":"Which one's the hazard?","em":[],"s":49.672,"e":51.222},{"w":"RAY","t":"both of them could be.","em":[0],"s":51.142,"e":52.585},{"w":"RAY","t":"A sharp that's hidden in other material or mixed into regular trash puts the next person at risk.","em":[],"s":52.585,"e":58.677},{"w":"DANA","t":"Even if you're not sure it's a sharp?","em":[],"s":58.597,"e":61.002},{"w":"RAY","t":"Yes, even then.","em":[],"s":61.002,"e":62.111},{"w":"RAY","t":"Spotting a hazard early prevents injuries, even when you can't be sure what it is yet.","em":[],"s":62.111,"e":67.575},{"w":"DANA","t":"So the hazard counts before you even know what it is.","em":[],"s":67.575,"e":71.022},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's it.","em":[],"s":71.022,"e":71.741},{"w":"RAY","t":"And for the container, the rule is simple: at the fill line, it's full.","em":[],"s":71.741,"e":76.392},{"w":"DANA","t":"Honestly, if it looked roomy, I figured it was fine.","em":[],"s":76.392,"e":80.64}]},"04_03-f2.mp3":{"dur":72.96,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"If I'm wearing thick gloves, do I even need a sharps container?","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":3.92},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, it's a fair question, so let's make it a real choice.","em":[],"s":3.92,"e":7.815},{"w":"RAY","t":"Suppose a plant wants to protect its people, but it can only do one thing.","em":[],"s":7.815,"e":12.678},{"w":"RAY","t":"It can hand out heavier gloves, or it can put sharps containers on every line.","em":[],"s":12.678,"e":17.76},{"w":"DANA","t":"I think I'd pick the gloves.","em":[],"s":17.68,"e":19.492},{"w":"DANA","t":"They're right there on your hands.","em":[],"s":19.492,"e":21.68},{"w":"RAY","t":"That makes sense, and heavy-duty gloves do help.","em":[],"s":21.6,"e":24.665},{"w":"RAY","t":"They protect you against cuts and punctures.","em":[],"s":24.665,"e":27.44},{"w":"DANA","t":"I can hear a \"but\" coming.","em":[],"s":27.44,"e":29.84},{"w":"RAY","t":"The catch is that a needle can get through even a thick glove.","em":[9],"s":29.84,"e":33.927},{"w":"RAY","t":"Imagine a needle tip pressed against a heavy work glove, and it can still push through.","em":[],"s":33.927,"e":38.4},{"w":"DANA","t":"Huh.","em":[],"s":38.32,"e":38.674},{"w":"DANA","t":"I kind of assumed a thick glove would stop just about anything.","em":[],"s":38.674,"e":43.04},{"w":"DANA","t":"So what does the container do that the glove can't?","em":[],"s":43.04,"e":46.4},{"w":"RAY","t":"A safety-engineered sharps container is what's called an engineering control.","em":[],"s":46.4,"e":50.977},{"w":"RAY","t":"That means it works on the sharp itself, because once the sharp drops in, the container holds it inside.","em":[],"s":50.977,"e":57.12},{"w":"DANA","t":"So the gloves are on me, and the container is on the sharp.","em":[12],"s":57.12,"e":60.96},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's really the difference.","em":[],"s":60.96,"e":62.8},{"w":"DANA","t":"So is the glove enough on its own?","em":[],"s":62.8,"e":65.6},{"w":"RAY","t":"No.","em":[],"s":65.6,"e":65.869},{"w":"RAY","t":"The gloves still help, but on their own they give you less protection.","em":[],"s":65.869,"e":70.64},{"w":"DANA","t":"Okay.","em":[],"s":70.56,"e":71.056},{"w":"DANA","t":"That changes my answer.","em":[],"s":71.056,"e":72.96}]},"06_04-f1-normal.mp3":{"dur":86.96,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Here's a quick story about a needle that ended up in the regular trash.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":4.352},{"w":"DANA","t":"We'll let Jacob tell this story.","em":[],"s":4.352,"e":6.32},{"w":"BOYD","t":"Hey, my name's Jacob, and I work on the sanitation crew.","em":[],"s":6.32,"e":10.4},{"w":"BOYD","t":"It's the end of the day, and I'm pulling the bag out of the bin by the line.","em":[],"s":10.32,"e":14.72},{"w":"BOYD","t":"I tie it off and lift it, and something jabs me right through the plastic.","em":[],"s":14.64,"e":19.52},{"w":"BOYD","t":"I look down, and there's a needle sticking out the side of the bag.","em":[],"s":19.44,"e":23.83},{"w":"BOYD","t":"I never even saw it but it poked into my leg.","em":[],"s":23.83,"e":26.8},{"w":"DANA","t":"Ok, that's terrible.","em":[],"s":26.72,"e":28.429},{"w":"DANA","t":"So where did that needle come from?","em":[],"s":28.429,"e":31.36},{"w":"RAY","t":"It came from Chris, who works on the line.","em":[],"s":31.28,"e":34.024},{"w":"RAY","t":"He manages his diabetes with insulin.","em":[],"s":34.024,"e":36.4},{"w":"DANA","t":"So how does his needle end up in the trash?","em":[],"s":36.4,"e":39.6},{"w":"RAY","t":"One afternoon he's in the middle of a task, and he can't find a sharps container nearby.","em":[],"s":39.6,"e":45.272},{"w":"RAY","t":"So, just this once, he drops the used needle in the trash.","em":[3],"s":45.272,"e":49.04},{"w":"DANA","t":"You know, I can picture doing that.","em":[],"s":49.04,"e":51.398},{"w":"DANA","t":"You're busy, and the trash is right there.","em":[],"s":51.398,"e":54.16},{"w":"RAY","t":"And it's only one time, so it doesn't feel like a big deal.","em":[],"s":54.16,"e":58.0},{"w":"DANA","t":"But what about Jacob?","em":[],"s":58.0,"e":59.76},{"w":"RAY","t":"Jacob never used that needle, and he never saw it until it went through the bag.","em":[],"s":59.76,"e":65.181},{"w":"RAY","t":"And a needlestick can expose you to H-I-V, hepatitis B and hepatitis C.","em":[],"s":65.181,"e":70.0},{"w":"DANA","t":"And all he did was take out the trash.","em":[],"s":69.92,"e":73.12},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's the part that gets me.","em":[],"s":73.04,"e":75.185},{"w":"RAY","t":"Chris made the choice, but Jacob is the one who got stuck.","em":[],"s":75.185,"e":79.2},{"w":"RAY","t":"You know, a sharp in the wrong place can hurt someone who never handled it.","em":[13],"s":79.12,"e":83.68},{"w":"DANA","t":"The last bag you filled at work...","em":[],"s":83.6,"e":85.819},{"w":"DANA","t":"who picked it up?","em":[],"s":85.819,"e":86.96}]},"05_04-f1-addon.mp3":{"dur":19.76,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"So what happens after a needlestick like that?","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.96},{"w":"RAY","t":"There's a report to a supervisor, and then there's a medical evaluation, with testing for H-I-V and hepatitis B.","em":[],"s":2.96,"e":10.48},{"w":"DANA","t":"And what happens after the testing?","em":[],"s":10.48,"e":12.96},{"w":"RAY","t":"Then comes the waiting, and the results can take weeks.","em":[],"s":12.88,"e":16.88},{"w":"DANA","t":"That's a long time to carry a question around.","em":[],"s":16.8,"e":19.76}]},"08_05-f3-normal.mp3":{"dur":64.08,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"RAY","t":"Here's a number about what people actually do with used sharps.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":3.878},{"w":"RAY","t":"In one study, more than ninety percent of workers surveyed said they always use a sharps container.","em":[],"s":3.878,"e":8.64},{"w":"DANA","t":"always?","em":[0],"s":8.56,"e":9.2},{"w":"DANA","t":"To be honest, I'd have guessed about half.","em":[],"s":9.2,"e":12.64},{"w":"DANA","t":"When I think of a busy line, the container's always a long walk away.","em":[],"s":12.64,"e":17.332},{"w":"DANA","t":"So I picture people tossing blades in the trash.","em":[],"s":17.332,"e":20.56},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's the version people tend to tell each other.","em":[],"s":20.48,"e":23.373},{"w":"RAY","t":"But most people walk it over to the container.","em":[1],"s":23.373,"e":25.92},{"w":"RAY","t":"Imagine someone on the line finishes a blade change, so they walk the used blade down to the container.","em":[],"s":25.92,"e":31.92},{"w":"DANA","t":"And then what happens?","em":[],"s":31.84,"e":33.36},{"w":"RAY","t":"They drop it in and walk back to work, already thinking about the next job.","em":[],"s":33.36,"e":37.92},{"w":"DANA","t":"Then why does it feel like everyone uses the trash?","em":[],"s":37.84,"e":41.52},{"w":"RAY","t":"Because tossing it in the trash is the one you remember, and it's the one people bring up at lunch.","em":[],"s":41.44,"e":47.04},{"w":"RAY","t":"You know, nobody ever tells a story about walking to the container, because it's too normal to mention.","em":[],"s":46.96,"e":52.8},{"w":"DANA","t":"So the trash gets all the attention.","em":[],"s":52.72,"e":55.28},{"w":"RAY","t":"It does.","em":[],"s":55.28,"e":55.829},{"w":"RAY","t":"And the walk to the container is just what most people do on a normal day.","em":[],"s":55.829,"e":60.4},{"w":"DANA","t":"Next time I'm walking one down, I won't feel like the odd one out.","em":[],"s":60.32,"e":64.08}]},"07_05-f3-addon.mp3":{"dur":20.16,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"RAY","t":"Think about a normal shift, where blades get changed all morning.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":3.6},{"w":"DANA","t":"So where does each of those blades end up?","em":[],"s":3.6,"e":6.32},{"w":"RAY","t":"Almost every one goes to the container.","em":[],"s":6.32,"e":8.754},{"w":"RAY","t":"Someone walks it down and walks back, and then someone else does the same thing.","em":[],"s":8.754,"e":13.68},{"w":"DANA","t":"And nobody says anything about it?","em":[],"s":13.6,"e":16.08},{"w":"RAY","t":"No, not a word.","em":[],"s":16.08,"e":17.248},{"w":"RAY","t":"Walking it down is just part of the job.","em":[],"s":17.248,"e":20.16}]},"09_06-close.mp3":{"dur":10.147,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"That's all for this one.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":1.353},{"w":"DANA","t":"Thanks for spending a few minutes with us.","em":[],"s":1.353,"e":3.68},{"w":"RAY","t":"Look after each other out there.","em":[],"s":3.68,"e":5.558},{"w":"RAY","t":"See you next time.","em":[],"s":5.558,"e":6.64}]},"12_CONTINUE.mp3":{"dur":2.742,"env":"cdkzqkec8974553332222abhgggeddeeffeecbb819bffababfddee96gc9cccda887a986563000000000","sents":[{"w":"","t":"You may now continue the lesson.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.742}]},"10_qt-k1.mp3":{"dur":57.28,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Here's a quick one about a used blade.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.265},{"w":"DANA","t":"Say you've just finished a blade change, and the old blade is still in your hand.","em":[],"s":2.265,"e":7.014},{"w":"DANA","t":"What do you do with it?","em":[],"s":7.014,"e":8.4},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, you might want to set it down for a minute, or drop it in the nearest trash can.","em":[],"s":8.4,"e":13.817},{"w":"RAY","t":"But neither one is safe.","em":[1],"s":13.817,"e":15.36},{"w":"DANA","t":"Why not, if it's only for a minute?","em":[],"s":15.28,"e":17.84},{"w":"RAY","t":"Because a used blade is a hazard even when it looks clean.","em":[],"s":17.84,"e":21.931},{"w":"RAY","t":"The next person who reaches for that spot, or that bag, is at risk.","em":[],"s":21.931,"e":25.68},{"w":"DANA","t":"So what's the right way to handle it?","em":[],"s":25.6,"e":28.08},{"w":"RAY","t":"There are four steps.","em":[],"s":28.08,"e":29.603},{"w":"RAY","t":"One, know your route to a sharps container before you start.","em":[],"s":29.603,"e":33.827},{"w":"RAY","t":"Two, use a safer tool if one will do the job.","em":[],"s":33.827,"e":37.016},{"w":"RAY","t":"Three, turn on the safety feature if there is one.","em":[],"s":37.016,"e":40.549},{"w":"RAY","t":"Four, put the used blade straight into a designated sharps container.","em":[],"s":40.549,"e":45.36},{"w":"DANA","t":"I guess that sounds simple enough.","em":[],"s":45.28,"e":47.514},{"w":"DANA","t":"Does it change if the container is far away?","em":[],"s":47.514,"e":50.24},{"w":"RAY","t":"No, it doesn't.","em":[],"s":50.24,"e":51.297},{"w":"RAY","t":"Actually, the whole rule comes down to this: a used blade goes straight into the container.","em":[12],"s":51.297,"e":57.28}]},"11_qt-k2.mp3":{"dur":52.4,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Here's a quick one about sharps containers.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.729},{"w":"DANA","t":"Say you walk up to one, and it's past the fill line.","em":[],"s":2.729,"e":6.022},{"w":"DANA","t":"The used blades are crowded right at the opening.","em":[],"s":6.022,"e":9.135},{"w":"DANA","t":"What do you do?","em":[],"s":9.135,"e":10.08},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, it's tempting to press them down to make room, or to squeeze one more in.","em":[],"s":10.08,"e":15.2},{"w":"DANA","t":"What's wrong with pressing them down?","em":[],"s":15.12,"e":17.12},{"w":"RAY","t":"Pressing down puts your hand right next to used blades.","em":[6],"s":17.04,"e":20.853},{"w":"RAY","t":"When a container reaches its fill line, it's full, so you use another designated container.","em":[],"s":20.853,"e":25.84},{"w":"DANA","t":"Okay.","em":[],"s":25.84,"e":26.256},{"w":"DANA","t":"Anything else I should be looking for?","em":[],"s":26.256,"e":28.96},{"w":"RAY","t":"Yes, a sharp that's out of place.","em":[],"s":28.96,"e":31.14},{"w":"RAY","t":"That could be on a work surface, hidden in other material, or in the regular trash.","em":[],"s":31.14,"e":36.528},{"w":"RAY","t":"Either way, it puts the next person at risk.","em":[],"s":36.528,"e":39.36},{"w":"DANA","t":"So there are really two different things to spot.","em":[],"s":39.28,"e":42.32},{"w":"RAY","t":"You know, that's exactly it, and spotting either one early prevents injuries.","em":[],"s":42.24,"e":47.2},{"w":"DANA","t":"Good to know.","em":[],"s":47.2,"e":48.4},{"w":"RAY","t":"Just remember that when a container is at the fill line, it's full.","em":[12],"s":48.4,"e":52.4}]}}